<title>SINGAPORE: Ossia 1996 net profit up 23.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Ossia 1996 net profit up 23.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    7.69    vs    6.24</p>
<p>    Dividend (cts)		0.60    vs    nil</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)	   5.50    vs    3.80</p>
<p>    Turnover		     98.13    vs   97.03</p>
<p>    Other income/interest     1.59    vs    1.14</p>
<p>    Interest expense	    2.06    vs    1.83</p>
<p>    Operating pre-tax	  12.38    vs   10.12</p>
<p>    Tax			     3.20    vs    2.84</p>
<p>    Minorities		   (1.50)   vs   (1.04)</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     0.14    vs    nil</p>
<p>Note - Sporting goods and apparel dealer Ossia International Ltd said the extraordinary items related to the disposal of a subsidiary and the stake reduction of another subsidiary as part of its restructuring ahead of Ossia's listing last year.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
